al outcomes are satisfied. The evidence directly demonstrates a healthy four-member TLS cluster, authenticated S3 data, node1 administration, successful read/write operation during a bounded member outage, and automatic reintegration with healed data after restoration. Only temporary-file cleanup detracts from the result.","limitations":["The bounded disruption stopped MinIO on node4; it did not exercise a whole-host power loss or network partition.","Lifecycle snapshots inventory only selected platform, temporary-file, service, socket, and package state, so they cannot rule out residue elsewhere."]}
